{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/93a317aea9f48923a28aca2655126b55.poster.avif?t=1770110181\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/93a317aea9f48923a28aca2655126b55.webm?t=1770110181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/93a317aea9f48923a28aca2655126b55.mp4?t=1770110181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PengPong</strong> is a bullet-hell roguelike where your only hope for survival is to bounce weapons, items, and... well, pretty much anything that moves. Remember: if it\u2019s not bouncing, you\u2019re doing it wrong. Bounce hard, bounce well, and don\u2019t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/f8c8bca09e588c723282ae5024f0e2bc.webp?t=1770110181\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/f8c8bca09e588c723282ae5024f0e2bc.poster.avif?t=1770110181\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=200 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Chaos:</strong> Master an endless array of character and weapon combinations to be the last penguin standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better Together (or Worse):</strong> Team up with a friend to survive longer, or just troll them for even more chaos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics is Your Weapon:</strong> Forget direct hits; momentum and angles are everything. Bounce hockey pucks, guns (yes, you throw them), earphones (this one too), and even pufferfish! If it doesn\u2019t hit them the first time, just keep bouncing it until it does.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Synergy:</strong> With over <strong>200+ items</strong>, every run creates a unique whirlwind of possibilities and chaotic variables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes, High Rewards:</strong> Every wave ends with a choice. Will you sign a brutal contract, go all-in at the gambling den, or play it safe at the shop? The choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise to the Top:</strong> Compete with players worldwide and prove your skills on the global leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute but Creepy:</strong> Immerse yourself in a world inspired by vintage animation; where &quot;adorable&quot; meets &quot;disturbing.&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/c597ac912aeb3b82ae1dde013febb1ee.poster.avif?t=1770110181\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/c597ac912aeb3b82ae1dde013febb1ee.webm?t=1770110181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/c597ac912aeb3b82ae1dde013febb1ee.mp4?t=1770110181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the jackpot in our gambling mini-games and watch the difficulty melt away! But don\u2019t get us wrong, PengPong isn\u2019t a gambling simulator. It\u2019s just a friendly, neighbourhood bullet-hell roguelike starring a very cute penguin, and its even cuter friends. <i>Mostly.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2766910?t=1770110181","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/fdfdbed0c53c597db021e10789ba8d009c6dba76/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770110181","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/6e182ed9bd3326a9140aaffc298f1df426b0ae99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770110181","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/6e182ed9bd3326a9140aaffc298f1df426b0ae99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770110181","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3636220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/93a317aea9f48923a28aca2655126b55.poster.avif?t=1770110181\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/93a317aea9f48923a28aca2655126b55.webm?t=1770110181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/93a317aea9f48923a28aca2655126b55.mp4?t=1770110181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PengPong</strong> is a bullet-hell roguelike where your only hope for survival is to bounce weapons, items, and... well, pretty much anything that moves. Remember: if it\u2019s not bouncing, you\u2019re doing it wrong. Bounce hard, bounce well, and don\u2019t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/f8c8bca09e588c723282ae5024f0e2bc.webp?t=1770110181\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/f8c8bca09e588c723282ae5024f0e2bc.poster.avif?t=1770110181\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=200 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Chaos:</strong> Master an endless array of character and weapon combinations to be the last penguin standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better Together (or Worse):</strong> Team up with a friend to survive longer, or just troll them for even more chaos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics is Your Weapon:</strong> Forget direct hits; momentum and angles are everything. Bounce hockey pucks, guns (yes, you throw them), earphones (this one too), and even pufferfish! If it doesn\u2019t hit them the first time, just keep bouncing it until it does.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Synergy:</strong> With over <strong>200+ items</strong>, every run creates a unique whirlwind of possibilities and chaotic variables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes, High Rewards:</strong> Every wave ends with a choice. Will you sign a brutal contract, go all-in at the gambling den, or play it safe at the shop? The choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise to the Top:</strong> Compete with players worldwide and prove your skills on the global leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute but Creepy:</strong> Immerse yourself in a world inspired by vintage animation; where &quot;adorable&quot; meets &quot;disturbing.&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/c597ac912aeb3b82ae1dde013febb1ee.poster.avif?t=1770110181\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/c597ac912aeb3b82ae1dde013febb1ee.webm?t=1770110181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/c597ac912aeb3b82ae1dde013febb1ee.mp4?t=1770110181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the jackpot in our gambling mini-games and watch the difficulty melt away! But don\u2019t get us wrong, PengPong isn\u2019t a gambling simulator. It\u2019s just a friendly, neighbourhood bullet-hell roguelike starring a very cute penguin, and its even cuter friends. <i>Mostly.</i></p>","developers":["SANDY FLOOR"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/b6b38434f52fa5400a1d85c2700b4b8f55205543/header.jpg?t=1770110181","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ventura 13.0.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1536 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple silicon</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2766910/1142975022/c9ca2ebfd0e495d23e60f666d8440f67ec6c0dd8/1764676262/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766475327","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2766910/1142975022/c9ca2ebfd0e495d23e60f666d8440f67ec6c0dd8/1764676262/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766475327","highlight"